        <DisplayName>Pioneer VI-S</DisplayName>
        <Description>The Pioneer VI-S is a compact scout vessel designed for rapid deployment and exploration. This agile ship excels at navigating tight spaces and gathering data. While equipped with defensive weaponry, its primary focus is on speed and evasion. Perfect for lone explorers or as part of a larger fleet.</Description>
